"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巷では姫将軍とまで言われているが、本人は気恥ずかしいので言われるのを嫌っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90060"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/409604df1b039578d9657f69efaf6fb5b6f551c4d71a8969f63356594d120962.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16d2192437c70f843dd553d3ffab245fd4819ebb14d4418371d06c7f8ed74b48.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:225090:90060:4956:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31953","characterName":"ユミリア・アンバルド","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90061","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"225090"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13755"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31953"},"originalCharacterName":"ユミリア・アンバルド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アンバルド神聖王国の第二王女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇猛なアーシスとは対照的に、物腰柔らかく、気弱で大人しい少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔を封じる“封印の巫女”の素質を備えていることから、周囲から大事に扱われてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者クロードに密かな恋心を抱いていたが、自分の立場もあり、表立って気持ちを伝えることはなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クロードの肉体を乗っ取った主人公は、そんな彼女の気持ちを逆手に取って……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13755","sourceWorkId":"9721","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アンバルド神聖王国の第二王女。物腰柔らかでおとなしい少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来は気弱な少女だが、封印の巫女の痣が現れたことから、巫女として丁重に扱われてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クロードに密かな恋心を抱いているが、周りからの期待もあり、常に一歩引いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リバルトはそれを逆手に取り、真っ先にユミリアを籠絡していく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90061"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a200c847981542757e79f460c57ee44b8d7ff7ceb4ba058272226a0ce891eb39.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/859f0cdf258416a17f29af72b2cec91842a09e5c86f5d7bbd338802add76ec80.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:225090:90061:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31954","characterName":"ガーネット","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90062","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"225090"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13759"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31954"},"originalCharacterName":"ガーネット","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者クロードの魔王討伐隊に参加した、おっとり巨乳の女性神官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にマイペースで、ゆっくりした口調で話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪戯が大好きで、勇者であるクロードを、その豊満な肉体で誘惑することもあったとか……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13759","sourceWorkId":"9721","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者パーティーに参加していた神官。おっとりした性格で言葉もゆっくりな巨乳神官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いたずら好きで、豊満な肉体を強調し、クロードを誘惑するそぶりを何度も見せたりもしていた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90062"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/6227fbe7b2ace7f60f83276f6c4089f79e21b57ccd7a63831518a1b01a22869a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/40c2596fc7df00bed55503670d6ee69b1b468a63ec8a36171438361cd7e5604d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中田順子","creatorId":"vndb:s631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s631","name":"中田 順子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:225090:90062:4463:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31955","characterName":"シルヴィナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90063","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"225090"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13758"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31955"},"originalCharacterName":"シルヴィナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者クロードの魔王討伐隊に参加した、超一流の魔術師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は可愛らしいが、クールを超えて冷淡な女の子。特に男性に対してはさらに冷たい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"故に氷の魔法が得意（？）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が嫌いな人間や事柄をとことん嫌い妥協もしない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者であるクロードにさえも一定の距離を保っていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13758","sourceWorkId":"9721","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者パーティーに参加していた魔術師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実力は超一級で、氷の魔法を得意とする。性格はクールを超えて冷淡で、特に男性には冷たい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に嫌いな者はとことん嫌う性格で、大臣などには非常に評判が悪い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クロードとは比較的多めに話しているものの、一定の距離は保っていた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90063"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e71e3c6c69b728f042865c52176d809a305a6bdef780aef95b77395698d7a89f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b79a7993fd3a37afc5f0cc9e07bfe63b618b18f0a8d58e6cd8c36c385eb0434.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"倉田まりや","creatorId":"vndb:s789","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s789","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s789","name":"澄田 まりや","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:225090:90063:6018:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31956","characterName":"レジーナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90064","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"225090"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13757"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31956"},"originalCharacterName":"レジーナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者クロードの魔王討伐隊に参加した、勇猛な女戦士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姫将軍・アーシスの親衛隊隊長でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭よりも先に行動するタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"野生の感も鋭く、死線を何度も潜り抜けてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者であるクロードを気に入っていたが、魔王に入れ替わってからは、その野生の感が働き、警戒心を抱くように……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13757","sourceWorkId":"9721","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者パーティーに参加していた女戦士。アーシスの親衛隊の隊長でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭より身体を使う方が得意で、野生のカンで前衛を担っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クロードのことは気に入ったいたが、魔王が入れ替わってからは、野生のカンで警戒心を抱いていた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90064"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3cbdb2cb3aa5a7a2468be02ce668bd1088919b53faff9be3c48b69832a840fa7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb3e2a665a3e3b3312659607102b52a8604fcd2f4d367bcb56df91130a4109d4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西沢広香","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"榊木春乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:225090:90064:5890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31957","characterName":"イーリス・アンバルド","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90065","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"225090"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13756"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31957"},"originalCharacterName":"イーリス・アンバルド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"現アンバルド神聖王国の王妃。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先代の“封印の巫女”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女の力は、第二王女のユミリアに受け継がれ、実質的な役目を終えているが、その穏和で優しい性格と美しさから、今もなお国民からの人気が高く、慕われている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13756","sourceWorkId":"9721","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アンバルド神聖王国の王妃。既に巫女としての力を失い、すでに国の飾りとなっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが穏和な性格から国民からは人気があり、国王を支える妻としても信頼が厚い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90065"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa9b092e687e7f5c7c7273ce97aedb2e35100461180e95342099af76dbe0605b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae215849cebcdc7a43623a370ba3f614f65cebc8ab8816027c866b6dad2dfc8b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雨宮侑布","creatorId":"vndb:s1450","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1450","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1450","name":"雨宮 侑布","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:225090:90065:4940:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31958","characterName":"シャロン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90066","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"225090"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13760"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31958"},"originalCharacterName":"シャロン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔王を倒し凱旋した勇者、クロードに新しく付くことに新米メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"健気で大人しい性格の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に臆病で、いつも謝ってばかりいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13760","sourceWorkId":"9721","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新しくクロード付きになった新米のメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"健気な性格だが臆病で、いつも謝ってばかりいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90066"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0a16985f9551e6a54471be1bc409105c937da64d38398e9d8880bdb949eacd83.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d583265c86b2f6ae3304e539d2074204aae87063675f8c6b60899e12af59e054.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大久保藍子","creatorId":"vndb:s361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s361","name":"大久保 藍子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:225090:90066:5075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c51852","characterName":"リバルト・エデュール","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90069","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"225090"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13761"],"vndbCharacterId":"c51852"},"originalCharacterName":"リバルト・エデュール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇者の肉体を乗っ取った魔族を統べる王。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"残忍で狡猾な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"精神が死滅しながらも勇者の力は健在で、それが魔王の魂を束縛しているため、以前の力が発揮できないでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、テレパシーを駆使して配下の魔物に指示を出すなどして、人